    "title": "Big Bounce America is coming to the Helotes Fairgrounds this weekend! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By San Antonio Living ,\n7 hours ago\nA one-of-a-kind tour is coming to San Antonio this weekend, it's the world's biggest bounce house! Connor Market was here to tell us all about Big Bounce America. Big Bounce America is at the Helotes Fairgrounds, and you'll be able to experience bounce house to the extreme! Their bounce castle is the largest bounce castle in the world.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
